---
const demoUrl = '/mystery-check-demo/';
---
<section class="mc-preview" aria-labelledby="mc-preview-title">
  <div class="mc-preview__paper" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/demo/mystery-check/cover.webp" width="620" height="877" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    <span class="mc-preview__pagecount">18 Seiten. Konkrete nächste Schritte.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="mc-preview__copy">
    <p class="mc-preview__label">Ein Blick in das Ergebnis</p>
    <h2 id="mc-preview-title">Was Sie nach dem<br />Check in der Hand haben.</h2>
    <p>Blättern Sie durch eine vollständige Beispiel-Auswertung oder hören Sie in die Podcast-Version hinein. Vom ersten Eindruck bis zum Maßnahmenplan – so wird aus dem Blick von außen eine klare Arbeitsgrundlage.</p>
    <ul><li>6 Kontaktpunkte aus Gästesicht</li><li>Konkrete Beobachtungen und ihre Wirkung</li><li>8 priorisierte Maßnahmen im Beispiel</li></ul>
    <a class="mc-preview__link" href={demoUrl}>Demo-Auswertung entdecken <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="mc-preview__audio" href={`${demoUrl}#podcast`}>Auswertung anhören · 14 Min. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <small>Fiktives Hotel mit Restaurant · ohne Anmeldung</small>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mc-preview{background:#fff;color:#2B2D2F;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(200px,.75fr) minmax(0,1.25fr);align-items:center;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto 2rem;padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem);border-radius:6px;isolation:isolate}
  .mc-preview__paper{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:270px;justify-self:center;margin:0 0 1.5rem}
  .mc-preview__paper::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:4px -6px -4px 6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e6e5;transform:rotate(3deg);z-index:-1}
  .mc-preview__paper img{background:white;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #dfe4e3;box-shadow:0 18px 35px -22px rgba(18,42,47,.36);transform:rotate(-3deg);transition:transform .4s}
  .mc-preview:hover .mc-preview__paper img{transform:rotate(-1deg)}
  .mc-preview__pagecount{position:absolute;bottom:-2.6rem;left:-1rem;right:-1rem;font-size:.69rem;text-align:center;color:var(--preview-muted,#62696a)}
  .mc-preview__label{color:#122a2f;font-size:.69rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;margin:0 0 1.2rem}
  .mc-preview__label::before{content:"";width:24px;height:1px;background:#ff6b4a}
  .mc-preview h2{color:var(--preview-heading,#122a2f);font-size:var(--preview-title,clamp(1.8rem,3.3vw,2.8rem));line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
  .mc-preview__copy>p:not(.mc-preview__label){font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--preview-muted,#586264);margin:0 0 1.3rem}
  .mc-preview ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 1.7rem;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.65}
  .mc-preview li{display:flex;gap:.65rem;margin:.35rem 0}
  .mc-preview li::before{content:"✓";color:var(--preview-check,#122a2f)}
  .mc-preview__link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.4rem;min-height:48px;padding:.75rem 1.2rem;border:1px solid #122a2f;border-radius:100px;text-decoration:none;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600;color:#122a2f;transition:background .2s,color .2s}
  .mc-preview__link span{color:var(--preview-arrow,#d84c30);font-size:1.3rem}
  .mc-preview__link:hover{background:#122a2f;color:#fff}
  .mc-preview__link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #d84c30;outline-offset:5px}
  .mc-preview small{display:block;color:var(--preview-muted,#62696a);font-size:.68rem;margin-top:.8rem}
  @media(max-width:650px){.mc-preview{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:2rem 1.35rem;gap:2.7rem}.mc-preview__paper{max-width:180px;order:2;margin-top:.3rem}.mc-preview__copy{order:1}.mc-preview__link{width:100%}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mc-preview__paper img{transition:none;transform:none}.mc-preview:hover .mc-preview__paper img{transform:none}}
  .mc-preview__audio{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;width:fit-content;min-height:44px;margin-top:.5rem;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:600;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}
  .mc-preview__audio:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ce5637;outline-offset:5px}
</style>
